    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, wadikaŋa, wamajilu, mukala wakabishaŋa kwawu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatiyilaŋa mwizu damuntuku; hetŋilaŋa kumuleja maanaku; hakuhwelelelana Yehovaku; hakundaminaŋa kwakwihi naNzambi yinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulamba twindi adi mukachi kawu hiyanyitupa abulumaŋa, ansompeshi indi hiyatuŋiwidi amelela; hiyashiyaloŋa chuma chishi ka kubudiduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuprofwetu twindi hiyantu akuhemesha, akwatilaŋa akwawu makasu. Atupristu twindi anajiloli malala, anamotoki nshimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova mukachi kawu waloŋa kwindi; hakela yakuheŋaku. Budidi hibudidi wedishaŋa wuŋaji windi hatooka, hakaŋanyaloŋaku; ilaŋa antu áheŋa hiyeluka nsonyuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nafumishuhu dehi nyuza, tuposhi twakumpwembu jawu twashala dehi twamukunkulwayi; nabundishi dehi nyikwakwa yamunyikala yawu, mubuli kuhita antu. Nyikala yawu yakisika dehi, himudi nawa muntuku, himwashakama nawa muntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelili nami, Chalala wakantiva woma, waketŋia kukuleja maana, kulonda akabuli kufumisha hindi hashakamaŋayi munamufuukwilili mwejima; ilaŋa wena amenekeli budidi nakutokesha mwelilaŋawu mwejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nchiŋililenu kushika nikwifuku dinakanyamuka nakukwatana. Muloŋa natoŋola dehi kupompesha nyuza, nakakumaŋeji mawanta, kulonda niichili kuhila kwami hadi wena, kwokuzuwa kwami kwasweja kwejima; muloŋa iseki dejima dakanoŋa nakesi kamukawu wami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, henohu nakabalumuna madimi anyuza akekali idimi ditooka, kulonda wejima wawu akatambikaŋa ijina daYehova, kulonda akamukala kelaŋa namuchima wawu wumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakunlembelela, wowu anyana kawantu ami amwaŋala, akafuma kwishinadi datuloŋa twamuEtiyopiya, akaleta himulambu wami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku odu hiwakatiya nsonyi yayuma yejima yiwelilaŋa yakumotoka izu damuku. Muloŋa henohu mukachi keyi nakafumishamu akwenu aluŋilaŋa nakudinka wanta, hiwakadivuna nawa cheŋi kumpidi yami yajilaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa nakashiya mukachi keyi atuzweŋi amona ihuŋu, diwu akabatama mwijina daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela akashalaku hiyakela mwakuheŋa, hela kuhosha mwakutwambaku; namutunwa twawu himwakamwekana nawa idimi dakudimbanaku. Muloŋa wena akadyaloŋa, akakambamaŋa, hikwakekala wakuyitiyisha womaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kaZiyona, imbaku chakola. Eyi Isarela, dikuwi. Eyi mwana kaYerusalema wamumbanda, tiyaku kuwaha, luŋaku namuchima wejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nafumishi dehi kusompesha kweyi, nahaŋi dehi chilumbu cheyi. Mwanta wawaIsarela, yowu Yehova, wudi mukachi keyi. Hiwakamona cheŋi yatamaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku denodu akamwila Yerusalema nawu, Eyi Ziyona bayi wutiya womaku; makaseyi bayi azeyaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova Nzambi yeyi wudi mukachi keyi, hichilobu wemikaŋa mushindu. Wakakuzaŋalela eyi nakutiya kuwaha, wakanooka mukukeŋa kwindi, chakakumonayi wakaluŋa nakwimba tumina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu adishonashonaŋa, adiŋi eyeyi, nakayipompesha kuchawija chakushiika; awa asendelaŋa chiteli chindi chadiŋi chakusawuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu nakayikoŋa antu ejima akukabishaŋa. Nakamwamwina wabalakataŋa, nakapompesha cheŋi ahaŋiluwu, adiŋi nansonyi yatiyakeni hanu heseki dejima nakayibalumuna kwikala chuma chakushimeka niijina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu nakayiŋa, henohu nakayipompesha. Muloŋa chinakafuntisha cheŋi kumesu enu akwenu ayili muwukoli, nakayibalumuna kwikala ijina nichuma chakushimeka mukachi kanyuza yejima yawantu ahanu heseki. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
